import{_ as i,o as n,c as a,a2 as o}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const g=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 230 | Realm and Civilization: How Individual Ascension Drives Collective Ascension","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 230 | Realm and Civilization: How Individual Ascension Drives Collective Ascension","no":230,"module":1,"tags":["Realm","Civilization","Individual Ascension","Collective Ascension","Symbiosis"],"related":["03-Symbiotic Civilization Charter","25-Symbiotic Feedback Loop Mechanism","26-Individual-Collective Balance Principle"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0230_模块1-境界与文明-个体升维如何带动集体升维.md","filePath":"en/0230_模块1-境界与文明-个体升维如何带动集体升维.md"}'),t={name:"en/0230_模块1-境界与文明-个体升维如何带动集体升维.md"};function s(r,e,l,c,h,d){return n(),a("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[o('<h1 id="entry-230-realm-and-civilization-how-individual-ascension-drives-collective-ascension" tabindex="-1">Entry 230 | Realm and Civilization: How Individual Ascension Drives Collective Ascension <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-230-realm-and-civilization-how-individual-ascension-drives-collective-ascension" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 230 | Realm and Civilization: How Individual Ascension Drives Collective Ascension&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 1 · In-Depth Realm Refinement | Baseline references: Documents 03, 25, 26</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-strong-ones-do-not-ascend-alone-they-lift-myriad-races-along" tabindex="-1">Introduction: Strong ones do not ascend alone; they lift Myriad Races along <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-strong-ones-do-not-ascend-alone-they-lift-myriad-races-along" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: Strong ones do not ascend alone; they lift Myriad Races along&quot;">​</a></h2><p>One of Heng Yuan Zhou (Wanling Hengmao Origin Cosmos)&#39;s core axioms is the collective ascension axiom: strong ones do not ascend alone, but lift Myriad Races forward in evolution together. This is not a moral slogan, but a precise mechanism design — how does individual realm advancement drive the entire civilization&#39;s realm advancement? How does the ascension effect propagate? Why in the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization does one person&#39;s breakthrough benefit ten million?</p><p>The six top-level axioms are directly embodied in the relationship between realm and civilization: the anti-predation axiom ensures individual ascension does not rely on predation; the republican axiom of Myriad Races is collective ascension&#39;s institutional foundation; the collective ascension axiom itself is this entry&#39;s theme; the causal self-discipline axiom ensures ascension propagation does not disturb karma; the law-first axiom ensures the propagation mechanism&#39;s law definitions are stable; the universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><p>This entry analyzes the complete propagation chain by which individual ascension drives collective ascension.</p><h2 id="i-five-channels-of-ascension-propagation" tabindex="-1">I. Five Channels of Ascension Propagation <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-five-channels-of-ascension-propagation" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Five Channels of Ascension Propagation&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Channel</th><th>Propagation Method</th><th>Beneficiary Range</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Knowledge</td><td>Cultivation insights auto-upload to the Alaya Network</td><td>Whole-network Myriad Races</td></tr><tr><td>Mentor</td><td>High-tier cultivators guide entry cultivators</td><td>Direct disciples + indirect students</td></tr><tr><td>Technology</td><td>Law engineering tech breakthroughs industrialized</td><td>Whole society</td></tr><tr><td>Anchor</td><td>Anchors maintained by high-tier cultivators strengthen the whole network</td><td>Anchor-covered regions</td></tr><tr><td>Law</td><td>Origin Realm strong ones fine-tune laws benefiting the entire cosmos</td><td>Entire cosmos</td></tr></tbody></table><h3 id="_1-1-knowledge-channel-alaya-network-s-automatic-propagation" tabindex="-1">1.1 Knowledge Channel: Alaya Network&#39;s Automatic Propagation <a class="header-anchor" href="#_1-1-knowledge-channel-alaya-network-s-automatic-propagation" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;1.1 Knowledge Channel: Alaya Network&#39;s Automatic Propagation&quot;">​</a></h3><p>Every realm breakthrough&#39;s cultivation insights, key epiphanies, and breakthrough experiences auto-upload to the Alaya Network. After labeling and classification, these become learning resources for whole-network cultivators. A Dao Origin cultivator&#39;s Dao-attainment epiphany can let tens of thousands of Law Origin cultivators avoid detours.</p><p>This is the &quot;one person attains Dao, Myriad Races benefit&quot; knowledge propagation mechanism — in predatory-faction systems, those who attain Dao hoard knowledge as private property; in the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, the enlightened&#39;s knowledge auto-shares network-wide.</p><h3 id="_1-2-mentor-channel-hierarchical-propagation-of-the-master-disciple-system" tabindex="-1">1.2 Mentor Channel: Hierarchical Propagation of the Master-Disciple System <a class="header-anchor" href="#_1-2-mentor-channel-hierarchical-propagation-of-the-master-disciple-system" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;1.2 Mentor Channel: Hierarchical Propagation of the Master-Disciple System&quot;">​</a></h3><p>Dao Origin and above cultivators have mentor duties, directly guiding a cohort of entry cultivators. These entry cultivators after growing up will in turn guide their own students — forming a hierarchical propagation chain. A Dao Integration strong one may have dozens of direct disciples and tens of thousands of indirect disciples. This mentor chain ensures high-tier cultivators&#39; experience is not just stored in databases, but truly passed down through face-to-face guidance.</p><h3 id="_1-3-technology-channel-industrial-propagation-of-law-engineering" tabindex="-1">1.3 Technology Channel: Industrial Propagation of Law Engineering <a class="header-anchor" href="#_1-3-technology-channel-industrial-propagation-of-law-engineering" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;1.3 Technology Channel: Industrial Propagation of Law Engineering&quot;">​</a></h3><p>Technology breakthroughs in law application by Transform Origin and above cultivators, through the law engineering system, are converted into public technology products — new cultivation assist devices, more efficient energy conversion apparatuses, safer breakthrough assistance systems. These technology products are popularized to whole society via the Joint Contracting mechanism, raising all cultivators&#39; efficiency.</p><p>A new law-perception tool invented by a Law Origin cultivator may triple the entry speed of Sense Origin cultivators nationwide. This is technology propagation.</p><h3 id="_1-4-anchor-channel-the-anchor-network-s-strengthening-effect" tabindex="-1">1.4 Anchor Channel: The Anchor Network&#39;s Strengthening Effect <a class="header-anchor" href="#_1-4-anchor-channel-the-anchor-network-s-strengthening-effect" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;1.4 Anchor Channel: The Anchor Network&#39;s Strengthening Effect&quot;">​</a></h3><p>Anchors maintained by Dao Integration and above cultivators&#39; stability and efficiency directly affect the entire region&#39;s cultivation environment. A well-guarded high-tier anchor can raise energy perception sensitivity, internal circulation efficiency, and lower breakthrough risk for all cultivators in the covered region.</p><p>This is the anchor channel — strong ones&#39; power diffuses through the anchor network into public infrastructure.</p><h3 id="_1-5-law-channel-origin-realm-s-cosmic-level-propagation" tabindex="-1">1.5 Law Channel: Origin Realm&#39;s Cosmic-Level Propagation <a class="header-anchor" href="#_1-5-law-channel-origin-realm-s-cosmic-level-propagation" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;1.5 Law Channel: Origin Realm&#39;s Cosmic-Level Propagation&quot;">​</a></h3><p>Origin Realm strong ones participating in cosmic law fine-tuning and optimization have cosmic-level impact. One fine-tuning of the &quot;energy conversion efficiency&quot; law may raise Transform Origin cultivators&#39; conversion efficiency across the entire cosmos by several percentage points. This is the highest tier of ascension propagation — one person&#39;s breakthrough benefits the entire cosmos.</p><h2 id="ii-balance-mechanism-between-individual-and-collective-ascension" tabindex="-1">II. Balance Mechanism Between Individual and Collective Ascension <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-balance-mechanism-between-individual-and-collective-ascension" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Balance Mechanism Between Individual and Collective Ascension&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Individual ascension driving collective ascension does not equal &quot;the individual sacrifices everything for the collective.&quot; The Anchor Symbiotic Civilization ensures balance between the two via the individual-collective balance principle (Document 26):</p><ul><li>The individual has the right to freely choose cultivation paths</li><li>The collective has the right to share individual results</li><li>The individual receives resource support from the collective</li><li>The collective receives evolution momentum from individual breakthroughs</li><li>The two form a positive feedback loop, not zero-sum game</li></ul><h2 id="iii-why-the-predatory-faction-cannot-achieve-collective-ascension" tabindex="-1">III. Why the Predatory Faction Cannot Achieve Collective Ascension <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-why-the-predatory-faction-cannot-achieve-collective-ascension" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Why the Predatory Faction Cannot Achieve Collective Ascension&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Why can predatory-faction systems not achieve &quot;individual ascension drives collective ascension&quot;? Because:</p><ul><li><strong>Knowledge monopoly</strong>: strong ones hoard methods, outsiders cannot learn</li><li><strong>Resource monopoly</strong>: strong ones occupy spiritual veins and mines, ordinary people have no resources to cultivate</li><li><strong>Class solidification</strong>: strong ones do not want latecomers to catch up</li><li><strong>Zero-sum thinking</strong>: strong ones believe &quot;if others are strong, I am weak&quot;</li></ul><p>The result: in predatory-faction systems, the highest-realm people become fewer and fewer, civilization&#39;s overall progress becomes slower and slower — ultimately locking the ceiling. This is the root cause of Tang-Luo systems&#39; &quot;fierce-realm ceiling.&quot;</p><h2 id="iv-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">IV. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Universal infinite backstop</strong>: the universal equal infinite law establishes that every being inherently possesses basic infinite power; the easygoing have a guarantee, strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose, predation naturally loses meaning</li><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: five propagation channels ensure individual breakthrough value is not wasted; one insight benefits ten million</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: collective ascension fundamentally negates &quot;ascending alone&quot; reasonableness — if you ascend without lifting everyone, your ascension is meaningless</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo systems&#39; individual ascension is unrelated to the collective; the strong get stronger, the weak weaker; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s individual ascension propagates through five channels into collective ascension</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: ascension propagation channels are open to every Myriad Races group, regardless of race or gender</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: from knowledge to technology to law, all propagation channels are fully open, reserving space for higher-realm ascension propagation</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Individual and collective ascension are not opposites — in the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, they are two sides of the same coin. One person ascending propagates through knowledge, mentor, technology, anchor, and law five channels into ten million people&#39;s ascension. This is the collective ascension axiom&#39;s concrete operating mode: not requiring strong ones to &quot;sacrifice themselves,&quot; but designing a mechanism such that strong ones&#39; every effort automatically benefits Myriad Races. Ascension is not one person&#39;s lonely climb, but Myriad Races&#39; collective upward wave.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./03-共生文明宪章.html">03-Symbiotic Civilization Charter</a> · <a href="./25-共生反馈循环机制.html">25-Symbiotic Feedback Loop Mechanism</a> · <a href="./26-个体与集体平衡原理.html">26-Individual-Collective Balance Principle</a></li></ul>',34)])])}const p=i(t,[["render",s]]);export{g as __pageData,p as default};
